$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=dchrgsef  LOC_AFTER=?

* The additive character exp ( 2 _pi _i A / N ) (Mathlib ZMod.stdAddChar at the class of A) is the A-th power of the primitive N-th root of unity ( -u 1 ^c ( 2 / N ) ).

s1::simpl |- ( ( N e. NN /\ A e. ZZ ) -> N e. NN )
s2::simpr |- ( ( N e. NN /\ A e. ZZ ) -> A e. ZZ )
